! Minimal fixture based on the fields patched by the legacy campaign script.
100001 RandSeed1   - random seed
"RanLux" RandSeed2   - random number generator
11 NumGrid_Y       - grid points in Y
11 NumGrid_Z       - grid points in Z
0.1 TimeStep       - seconds
1000.0 AnalysisTime - seconds
"ALL" UsableTime   - seconds
150.0 HubHt         - hub height
300.0 GridHeight    - grid height
300.0 GridWidth     - grid width
"IECKAI" TurbModel - turbulence model
"B" IECturbc       - turbulence class
"NTM" IEC_WindType - IEC wind type
150.0 RefHt         - reference height
12.0 URef           - mean wind speed
! unrelated template line must remain unchanged